rry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\nPartially addresses [#6151](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/6151) and [#7082](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7082)\r\n\r\nAdds a new `Curve3DMesh` primitive mesh class, enabling the generation of 3D geometry along a `Curve3D` path.\r\n- Multiple mesh profiles: Flat, Cross, Tube.\r\n- Width control (constant or via a `Curve` resource).\r\n- Adaptive tessellation and advanced configuration (orientation, up vector, edge extension, corner handling).\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- if #80753 is merged, curve orientation logic can be removed\r\n- optionally, remove overlap filtering and vertex interleaving logic, which will greatly reduce the code bloat\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b5239bb-c7e9-4087-aa07-f2b9bb53786d\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.gith